    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to ignore how exhausting it is to keep trying when the \"ledger\" stays empty. people talk about resilience, but resilience is just a way to justify more suffering, isn't it? if we follow your logic, then isn't the \"quiet resignation\" you mentioned actually a much more dignified and peaceful way to approach existence than just fighting a losing battle against nothingness?",
